bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">SBC Knowledge</a><a href="/contact" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Contact</a><a href="/contact" class="ml-2 bg-gold px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Discuss Your Project</a></nav><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation" class="rounded p-2 text-ink lg:hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="bg-ink"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://sbcgroup.in/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Case Studies","item":"https://sbcgroup.in/case-studies"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Building a Luxury Coffee Brand for India"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="shell py-3 text-paper/70 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px]"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a href="/case-studies" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Case Studies</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="font-medium text-paper" aria-current="page">Building a Luxury Coffee Brand for India</span></li></ol></nav></div><main><section class="bg-ink py-14"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><a href="/strategic-research-feasibility" class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[oklch(0.82_0.11_92.89)] transition-colors hover:text-gold-tint">Strategic Research &amp; Feasibility</a><h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-paper md:text-[2.5rem]">Building a Luxury Coffee Brand for India</h1><p class="mt-3 text-[12px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-paper/70">Specialty Coffee &amp; Premium F&amp;B<!-- --> · <!-- -->Market Research • Competitive Strategy • Business Model • Financial Feasibility<!-- --> · Client: <!-- -->Confidential</p></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 md:col-span-2"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="challenge" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">The Challenge</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A prospective entrepreneur was evaluating a premium coffee venture combining a flagship café, in-house roasting, D2C coffee, subscriptions and sustainable home coffee solutions.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><div class="border border-gold bg-gold-wash p-6"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-deep">The Key Question</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink">Could this be developed into a differentiated and scalable luxury coffee business in India?</p></div></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="approach" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Our Approach</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC evaluated:</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Indian coffee market &amp; consumer behaviour</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>International and Indian competitive benchmarks</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Luxury positioning and product strategy</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Café, roastery and D2C business models</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Subscription and capsule opportunities</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Sustainability and sourcing</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Investment, financial feasibility and risks</span></li></ul></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="strategy" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Strategic Direction</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The recommended model was built around:</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Flagship Café</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">In-house Roastery</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">D2C</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Subscriptions</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Sustainable Home Coffee</span></span></div></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The café would function as the brand and customer-acquisition engine, while D2C, subscriptions and home formats would create scalable recurring revenue.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="recommendations" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Key Recommendations</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Launch with one flagship experience</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Establish in-house roasting as a core capability</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Build D2C alongside the café</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Introduce subscriptions to drive repeat consumption</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Enter capsules only after validating demand</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Make sustainability a credible product differentiator</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Scale only against defined commercial triggers</span></li></ul></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="outcome" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Outcome</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC delivered a strategic feasibility framework and phased roadmap covering market opportunity, competitive positioning, business model, investment requirements, financial feasibility and implementation priorities. The objective was not to build another premium café — but to design a scalable luxury coffee platform around experience, product excellence, recurring consumption and sustainable convenience.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">This is the kind of evidence-first evaluation SBC runs for every<!-- --> <a href="/strategic-research-feasibility" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Strategic Research &amp; Feasibility</a> <!-- -->engagement before a rupee is committed.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[13px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Client identity and proprietary commercial information have been withheld for confidentiality.</p></div><aside aria-labelledby="author-bio-heading" class="mt-14 max-w-3xl border-t border-ink-tint pt-8"><h2 id="author-bio-heading" class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">About the Author</h2><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-5 border border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start"><img src="/images/founder/sagar-burse-author.webp" alt="Sagar Burse, PhD, Founder and Principal Consultant of Sagar Burse Consulting" width="112" height="112" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-square shrink-0 rounded-full border-2 border-gold object-cover"/><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Sagar Burse, PhD</p><p class="mt-1 font-display text-[15px] italic text-ink-soft">Founder &amp; Principal Consultant, Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC)</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Sagar Burse, PhD is the Founder and Principal Consultant of Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC), headquartered in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, advising institutions and founder-led businesses across institution building, strategic research and business operations.</p><p class="mt-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">PhD (Management), GLS University · MBA (Marketing), Gujarat University · UGC-NET and GSET qualified</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="/founder" rel="author" class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View Full Profile →</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/drsagarburse/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">LinkedIn →</a></div></div></div></aside><div class="mt-14 border-t border-ink-tint pt-8"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Related Case Study</p><a href="/case-studies/finance-compliance-venture-feasibility" class="mt-2 inline-block font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep">Building a Finance &amp; Compliance Services Venture for SMBs<!-- --> →</a></div><div class="!mt-10"><a class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold active" href="/case-s